{"5023870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Extraction Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 5023870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5079400], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extraction Shop Simulator is a first-person shop management sim set at the edge of the Exclusion Zone. Hunters buy your products. If you're selling good enough gear, they make it out. If not, you got paid either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/7066adc69c05d6200c98b572554a618e.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order stock, unpack crates, fill the shelves, set your prices. Fair prices bring customers back. Bad prices get noticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/0c11d282c6940d2c0b6010d1e77a757f.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters shop to fill the gaps in their load-out, from scrap masks to military armor. What you stock decides what they carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/cea1cedab31175cac181c933390e46b6.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overnight, your customers take what you sold them past the fence. The morning report tells you who made it back, and your reputation decides who shows up tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/b855d9d182bfcfc6c3b6bef73b17389f.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Administration's tiers to unlock new product lines, shop upgrades, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/7431fd0303058b0e5b1526651a0bc359.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers are here to steal. Spot the tells, and keep your reputation intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/e9e012a3edd723462b70df2f2d17b343.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell insurance on gear headed into the Zone, and send Runners to recover what your customers lost. More success means more rep.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extraction Shop Simulator is a first-person shop management sim set at the edge of the Exclusion Zone. Hunters buy your products. If you're selling good enough gear, they make it out. If not, you got paid either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/7066adc69c05d6200c98b572554a618e.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order stock, unpack crates, fill the shelves, set your prices. Fair prices bring customers back. Bad prices get noticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/0c11d282c6940d2c0b6010d1e77a757f.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters shop to fill the gaps in their load-out, from scrap masks to military armor. What you stock decides what they carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/cea1cedab31175cac181c933390e46b6.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overnight, your customers take what you sold them past the fence. The morning report tells you who made it back, and your reputation decides who shows up tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/b855d9d182bfcfc6c3b6bef73b17389f.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Administration's tiers to unlock new product lines, shop upgrades, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/7431fd0303058b0e5b1526651a0bc359.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers are here to steal. Spot the tells, and keep your reputation intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/extras/e9e012a3edd723462b70df2f2d17b343.webp?t=1788029364\" width=300 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell insurance on gear headed into the Zone, and send Runners to recover what your customers lost. More success means more rep.</p>", "short_description": "You're the vendor. They go into the Zone. You get rich either way. A first-person shop/management sim set on the edge of the Chernobyl exclusion zone. Inspired by the tone of Extraction Shooters but from the other side of the counter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/03ec57d69aeec644d89ff3d42a0d3f71afffbc9f/header.jpg?t=1788029364", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/00c573b5250ae1bf0ae932d587fda44f08936f48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788029364", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023870/00c573b5250ae1bf0ae932d587fda44f08936f48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788029364", "website": "https://extractionshopsimulator.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Amd Ryzen 5500 or Intel Core i5-12500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 3060Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  AMD Ryzen 5700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 3070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M4 Pro<br